        {"zh": "绿色黏液滴在石头上。", "en": "Green slime drips onto the stone."},
        {"zh": "它从地缝里一节节挤出来。", "en": "It squeezes up through the crack in sections."},
        {"zh": "暗处亮起两点竖瞳。", "en": "Two slit pupils light up in the dark."},
        {"zh": "它盘在入口，等你走进去。", "en": "It coils at the entrance, waiting for you to step in."}
